<title>YUGOSLAVIA: Yugoslav Feb oil imports fall to 190,872 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Yugoslav Feb oil imports fall to 190,872 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>BELGRADE 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistical Office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> YUGOSLAV CRUDE OIL IMPORTS    FEB 97   JAN 97	FEB 96</p>
<p> In tonnes			   190,872   219,436    4,693</p>
<p> In million USD		     35	  39	    1</p>
<p>OIL DERIVATIVES IMPORTS</p>
<p> In tonnes			   25,474     63,812     159,408</p>
<p> In million USD		     7	   16	   27</p>
<p>NOTES -- Cummulative January-February 1997 crude oil imports stood at 410,308 tonnes and totalled $74 million.</p>
<p>Cummulative 1997 oil derivatives imports stood at 106,935 tonnes and totalled $28 million.</p>
<p>-- Beti Biilandzic, Belgrade newsroom, 381 11 22243</p>
</text>
